+### Compound Format
+
+Pass `compound: true` to combine units, largest first, with zero-valued units skipped.
+
+```ts
+ms(5400000, { compound: true })       // "1h 30m"
+ms(90061000, { compound: true })      // "1d 1h 1m 1s"
+ms(-5400000, { compound: true })      // "-1h 30m"
+ms(500, { compound: true })           // "0s"
+```
+
+> [!NOTE]
+> Compound output uses days, hours, minutes and seconds only: it never goes above days, and leftover milliseconds are dropped. The `long` option takes precedence if both are set.
+
